	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "ACM0G8yQQEZELUB3x",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 16, DX 12, IQ 12, HT 12, HP 16, WILL 12, PER 12, FP 12, SPEED 6, MOVE 7, DODGE 10, DR 3. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "A7Yk5I2HOinLgHjQb",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 40 (offense 22, protection 18), threat tier standard, appearing 2."
		},
		{
			"id": "Ad-snB5aa3VqvnkN-",
			"text": "Fear Aura: An avoral can activate this ability to cause all creatures within 10 yards of him to make a Fright Check. The avoral can exclude any beings from the area of effect. If a victim succeeds at his Fright Check, he will be unaffected by the avoral’s Fear Aura for one hour."
		},
		{
			"id": "AfQgjoau4q1jW0JkX",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/avoral.gct"
		},
